Reverted by known_bugs.sh to reintroduce the bug fixed by c6881abb9:
realtime: the server's input_speech_started interrupts the playing reply 
(interrupt(source="audio_activity")), never the guarded pause: on a call a paused realtime reply 
outlived its ended generation, and the next server turn's interrupt cancelled that new response, 
leaving the agent silent; the fuzz server can now send the onset (RtEvent::SpeechStarted)

